Greedy Algorithm :

Simple Definition : "At Every Steps it picks what looks best right now (like better solution in that particular step)
                    without worrying about the future (Optimal Solution)"

🔹 Key Idea
    1.Solve the problem step by step
    2.At each step, choose the locally optimal (best) option
    3.Never go back and change decisions

